{
  "manifest_version": 1,
  "type": "device",
  "name": "RFPlayer",
  "description": {
    "en": "Ziblue RFPlayer 433/868 MHz dongle: sensors, remotes, alarms and RF actuators.",
    "fr": "Clé RFPlayer 433/868 MHz : capteurs, télécommandes, alarmes et actionneurs radio."
  },
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "docker_image": "ghcr.io/prohand/gladys-rfplayer:1.0.0",
  "gladys_version": ">=5.1.0",
  "cover_image": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/prohand/gladys-rfplayer/main/cover.png",
  "categories": ["protocols", "security", "environment"],
  "transports": ["local"],
  "config_schema": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "type": "section",
      "label": {
        "en": "Getting started",
        "fr": "Pour commencer"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The integration runs in a sandboxed container that cannot open a USB port: plug the RFPlayer into a machine of your network and expose its serial port over TCP with ser2net (or socat, an ESP-Link…), at 115200 bauds. Then type that address below. The documentation gives a ready-to-use ser2net configuration.",
        "fr": "L'intégration tourne dans un conteneur isolé qui ne peut pas ouvrir de port USB : branchez le RFPlayer sur une machine de votre réseau et exposez son port série en TCP avec ser2net (ou socat, un ESP-Link…), à 115200 bauds. Indiquez ensuite cette adresse ci-dessous. La documentation donne une configuration ser2net prête à l'emploi."
      },
      "links": [
        {
          "url": "https://github.com/prohand/gladys-rfplayer/blob/main/docs/en.md",
          "label": {
            "en": "Integration documentation",
            "fr": "Documentation de l'intégration"
          }
        },
        {
          "url": "https://github.com/cminyard/ser2net",
          "label": {
            "en": "ser2net",
            "fr": "ser2net"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "host",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Bridge host",
        "fr": "Hôte de la passerelle"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "IP address or name of the machine running the serial-to-TCP bridge. To reach the Gladys host itself, use its LAN IP (not localhost: the integration has its own network).",
        "fr": "Adresse IP ou nom de la machine qui fait tourner la passerelle série-TCP. Pour joindre la machine de Gladys elle-même, utilisez son IP sur le réseau local (pas localhost : l'intégration a son propre réseau)."
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "e.g. 192.168.1.10",
        "fr": "ex. 192.168.1.10"
      },
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "key": "port",
      "type": "number",
      "label": {
        "en": "Bridge TCP port",
        "fr": "Port TCP de la passerelle"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "TCP port the bridge listens on (ser2net example: 4000).",
        "fr": "Port TCP sur lequel écoute la passerelle (exemple ser2net : 4000)."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": 4000,
      "min": 1,
      "max": 65535
    },
    {
      "key": "receiver_protocols",
      "type": "multi_select",
      "label": {
        "en": "Protocols received",
        "fr": "Protocoles reçus"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Radio protocols the dongle decodes. Leave everything unticked to receive them all. Unticking the protocols you do not use reduces false detections and the neighbours heard.",
        "fr": "Protocoles radio décodés par la clé. Ne cochez rien pour tous les recevoir. Décocher les protocoles inutilisés réduit les fausses détections et les voisins entendus."
      },
      "required": false,
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "X10",
          "label": {
            "en": "X10",
            "fr": "X10"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "RTS",
          "label": {
            "en": "RTS",
            "fr": "RTS"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "VISONIC",
          "label": {
            "en": "VISONIC",
            "fr": "VISONIC"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "BLYSS",
          "label": {
            "en": "BLYSS",
            "fr": "BLYSS"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "CHACON",
          "label": {
            "en": "CHACON",
            "fr": "CHACON"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "OREGONV1",
          "label": {
            "en": "OREGONV1",
            "fr": "OREGONV1"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "OREGONV2",
          "label": {
            "en": "OREGONV2",
            "fr": "OREGONV2"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "OREGONV3/OWL",
          "label": {
            "en": "OREGONV3/OWL",
            "fr": "OREGONV3/OWL"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "DOMIA",
          "label": {
            "en": "DOMIA",
            "fr": "DOMIA"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "X2D",
          "label": {
            "en": "X2D",
            "fr": "X2D"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "KD101",
          "label": {
            "en": "KD101",
            "fr": "KD101"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "PARROT",
          "label": {
            "en": "PARROT",
            "fr": "PARROT"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "TIC",
          "label": {
            "en": "TIC",
            "fr": "TIC"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "FS20",
          "label": {
            "en": "FS20",
            "fr": "FS20"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "JAMMING",
          "label": {
            "en": "JAMMING",
            "fr": "JAMMING"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "EDISIO",
          "label": {
            "en": "EDISIO",
            "fr": "EDISIO"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "min_quality",
      "type": "number",
      "label": {
        "en": "Minimum radio quality",
        "fr": "Qualité radio minimale"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Frames heard with a quality below this value (1 to 10, as graded by the dongle) are ignored: raise it to 3 or 4 to stop picking up the neighbours. 0 keeps everything.",
        "fr": "Les trames entendues avec une qualité inférieure (1 à 10, notée par la clé) sont ignorées : montez à 3 ou 4 pour ne plus capter les voisins. 0 garde tout."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": 0,
      "min": 0,
      "max": 10
    },
    {
      "key": "jamming_threshold",
      "type": "number",
      "label": {
        "en": "Jamming detection threshold",
        "fr": "Seuil de détection de brouillage"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Sensitivity of the jamming detector built into the dongle: 1 is very sensitive (false alarms), 10 needs a jammer on both bands, 0 turns it off. The dongle default is 7.",
        "fr": "Sensibilité du détecteur de brouillage intégré à la clé : 1 est très sensible (fausses alertes), 10 demande un brouilleur sur les deux bandes, 0 le désactive. La valeur par défaut de la clé est 7."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": 7,
      "min": 0,
      "max": 10
    },
    {
      "key": "oregon_identity",
      "type": "select",
      "label": {
        "en": "Identify Oregon / OWL probes by",
        "fr": "Identifier les sondes Oregon / OWL par"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Their random address changes at every battery change. \"Address\" tells apart two identical probes on the same channel, but creates a new device after a battery change. \"Model and channel\" survives battery changes, as long as each probe of a model has its own channel. Changing this creates new devices.",
        "fr": "Leur adresse aléatoire change à chaque changement de piles. « Adresse » distingue deux sondes identiques sur le même canal, mais crée un nouvel appareil après un changement de piles. « Modèle et canal » survit aux changements de piles, tant que chaque sonde d'un modèle a son propre canal. Changer ce choix crée de nouveaux appareils."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": "address",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "address",
          "label": {
            "en": "Address",
            "fr": "Adresse"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "channel",
          "label": {
            "en": "Model and channel",
            "fr": "Modèle et canal"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "actuators",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Actuators",
        "fr": "Actionneurs"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Receivers the dongle drives, separated by \";\": Name = kind PROTOCOL address. Kinds: switch, light, shutter, button. Address: 0 to 255, or A1 to P16. Options: qualifier=n, burst=n. The \"Pair an actuator\" button fills this field for you.",
        "fr": "Récepteurs pilotés par la clé, séparés par « ; » : Nom = type PROTOCOLE adresse. Types : switch, light, shutter, button. Adresse : 0 à 255, ou A1 à P16. Options : qualifier=n, burst=n. Le bouton « Appairer un actionneur » remplit ce champ pour vous."
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "Living room shutter = shutter RTS 1; Desk lamp = switch CHACON 12",
        "fr": "Volet salon = shutter RTS 1; Lampe bureau = switch CHACON 12"
      },
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "key": "detector_kinds",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Detector types",
        "fr": "Types de détecteurs"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "On the air a door contact and a motion detector look the same. Tell which is which, separated by \";\": PROTOCOL id = kind (motion, opening, smoke, leak, vibration, presence). The id is shown in the widget. Unlisted detectors are motion detectors (smoke for KD101).",
        "fr": "Sur les ondes, un contact de porte et un détecteur de mouvement se ressemblent. Précisez lequel est lequel, séparés par « ; » : PROTOCOLE id = type (motion, opening, smoke, leak, vibration, presence). L'id est affiché dans le widget. Les détecteurs non listés sont des détecteurs de mouvement (fumée pour KD101)."
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "VISONIC 1166992416 = opening",
        "fr": "VISONIC 1166992416 = opening"
      },
      "required": false
    }
  ],
  "actions": [
    {
      "key": "test_connection",
      "label": {
        "en": "Test the connection",
        "fr": "Tester la connexion"
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 20
    },
    {
      "key": "pair_actuator",
      "label": {
        "en": "Pair an actuator",
        "fr": "Appairer un actionneur"
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 20,
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "pair_intro",
          "type": "section",
          "label": {
            "en": "Declare and pair a receiver",
            "fr": "Déclarer et appairer un récepteur"
          },
          "description": {
            "en": "Put the receiver in learning mode first (button pressed on a Chacon plug, PROG held on the remote of a Somfy RTS shutter…), then run this action: the dongle sends the pairing frame and the receiver is added to the Actuators field.",
            "fr": "Mettez d'abord le récepteur en mode apprentissage (bouton appuyé sur une prise Chacon, PROG maintenu sur la télécommande d'un volet Somfy RTS…), puis lancez cette action : la clé envoie la trame d'appairage et le récepteur est ajouté au champ Actionneurs."
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Name",
            "fr": "Nom"
          },
          "placeholder": {
            "en": "Living room shutter",
            "fr": "Volet salon"
          },
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "kind",
          "type": "select",
          "label": {
            "en": "Kind",
            "fr": "Type"
          },
          "required": true,
          "default": "switch",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "switch",
              "label": {
                "en": "Switch / plug",
                "fr": "Interrupteur / prise"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "light",
              "label": {
                "en": "Dimmable light",
                "fr": "Lampe variable"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "shutter",
              "label": {
                "en": "Shutter",
                "fr": "Volet"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "button",
              "label": {
                "en": "Button (gate, bell)",
                "fr": "Bouton (portail, sonnette)"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "protocol",
          "type": "select",
          "label": {
            "en": "Protocol",
            "fr": "Protocole"
          },
